#: ../../installation.rst:109
msgid ""
"Use *Add or remove programs* on Windows, or move the app to the Bin on "
"macOS. User data in ``%LOCALAPPDATA%\\Orbit`` is left in place; delete it "
"manually if you want a clean slate."
msgstr ""
"Windows 上使用 *添加或删除程序*，macOS 上把应用移到废纸篓即可。``%LOCALAPPDATA%\\Orbit`` "
"中的用户数据会被保留；若想彻底清理，请手动删除。"
